			"widgets_values":[
				"integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, shot on ARRI Alexa with 35mm anamorphic lenses and fine film grain, blended with high-end game-CG quality visual effects; a snow-covered imperial palace courtyard at night, with red walls, golden glazed roof tiles, stone guardian lions, a large bronze ding at the center, and falling snow under cold blue moonlight mixed with warm amber lantern glow. A wide low-angle shot frames two fighters already locked in combat: a tall young man in black silk robes with dark gold embroidered trim and a jade-crown topknot, wielding a long red-tasseled spear, and a young woman in a red-and-white hanfu with black armored bracers and a high ponytail held by a gold phoenix hairpin, wielding twin short swords with blue silk tassels. The camera trucks left with large amplitude at fast speed as the man sprints forward and thrusts the spear, the blade trailing a sharp gold energy arc. The woman crosses both swords to block; the collision emits an expanding gold-and-blue energy ripple and a shockwave ring that blasts the falling snow outward in a flat disk. She shoves his spear aside, spins, and slashes with both swords in a cross pattern leaving a blue X-shaped trail; the man leans back to dodge. [Shot 2] At 00:02.000, the shot cuts to a whip-pan medium shot as the man spins and sweeps the spear low, the blade trailing gold energy and kicking up a curving wave of snow. The woman leaps over the sweep, tucks, and drives both swords downward; the man plants his spear vertically and pole-vaults backward, avoiding the stab — her swords hit the stone and ice-blue energy cracks spread across the ground in a branching pattern. He lands on the roof of a covered corridor, then leaps off with a downward spear thrust, dislodging roof tiles as he goes. [Shot 3] At 00:04.200, the shot cuts to a side tracking shot at fast speed: the woman launches upward to meet his descending thrust, and their weapons collide mid-air in a cross-shaped gold-and-blue energy burst. They bounce apart, land, and instantly burst into a full sprint, crossing paths at high speed and trading four rapid strikes — spear, sword, sword, spear — as they pass; each collision emits a small energy ripple and a shower of orange sparks, leaving crisscrossing gold and blue energy trails hanging in the snowy air. They skid to a stop on opposite sides and turn immediately; the combined shockwave of their passing shatters a stone lantern, its fragments exploding outward in a burst of snow and glowing embers. [Shot 4] At 00:06.400, the shot cuts to a tight handheld close-up with strong shake as the man unleashes a rapid spear combo — thrust, horizontal sweep, thrust — each thrust leaving a short gold energy pierce trail. The woman blocks and dodges, gets inside his reach, and runs both sword blades upward along the spear shaft with a screech of blue energy, then grabs the shaft and tries to twist it away. He counters by driving forward, lifting her off the ground and slamming her into a stone guardian lion; the lion's head cracks off with a burst of gold energy and tumbles across the courtyard. She rolls out of the debris, kicks up a cloud of snow as a distraction, and throws one sword like a spinning projectile trailing blue energy; he deflects it with the spear, and it embeds itself in the red palace wall. [Shot 5] At 00:08.600, the shot cuts to a wide aerial shot pulling back with large amplitude at fast speed: the man pursues, leaping onto the palace wall and running along its top — each step emits a small gold energy pulse — before launching into a spinning spear attack that trails a gold energy spiral. The woman, now wielding only her remaining sword, leaps to meet him and deflects his strikes mid-air; they trade three rapid clashes above the courtyard, each collision sending a shockwave ring expanding through the falling snow. Then both slam down simultaneously onto the large bronze ding; the ding booms and dents, and a massive gold-and-blue ground shockwave ring expands outward, vaporizing snow on contact while the stone platform cracks in a radial pattern. [Shot 6] At 00:10.800, the shot cuts to a tracking shot driving forward at fast speed: the woman sprints to the red wall, yanks her embedded sword free with a blue energy pulse, and turns to find the man already pressing with a relentless spear flurry, each thrust trailing gold energy and driving her backward across the courtyard. She blocks with both swords crossed, her feet skidding through the snow, until her back hits the palace wall. At the last moment she drops low, sweeps his legs with one sword trailing blue energy, hooks his spear with the other, and pulls; he loses balance, and she pivots and hurls him over her shoulder into the covered corridor. Wooden pillars crack, roof tiles cascade down, and gold dust and snow explode outward; he emerges from the debris, spear still in hand. [Shot 7] At 00:13.000, the shot cuts to a crash zoom as both charge across the snow-covered courtyard. The man gathers power — the spear blade ignites with a dense gold energy aura and trails a thick gold tail as he thrusts with full force. The woman gathers power — both swords blaze with ice-blue energy, trailing twin blue tails as she spins into a dual cross-slash. Their attacks collide head-on in a blinding gold-and-blue energy burst and a massive shockwave ring that flattens all the snow in the courtyard, cracks the red walls, and sends roof tiles flying. For a beat they are locked, then the woman twists sideways so his spear grazes past her shoulder, sparks flying; she grabs the spear shaft with one hand, steps inside his guard, and drives the pommel of her other sword into his sternum in a single decisive strike. A concentrated ice-blue energy pulse erupts from the impact; the man drops his spear and is launched backward, skidding across the snow, and comes to rest on one knee, defeated. The woman stands over him, swords lowered, blue energy dissipating from the blades, as the full moon breaks through the clouds and snow continues to fall.\noverall_soundscape: Howling night wind sweeps across the palace courtyard with the soft crunch of falling snow and a distant palace bell, punctuated by the whoosh of flowing robes and spinning spear, ringing steel clashes, and the scrape of sword blades along metal. A stone lion's head cracks and tumbles, the bronze ding booms and dents under heavy impact, wooden pillars split, and roof tiles cascade down; both fighters trade short, controlled breaths and restrained grunts over the crunch of snow underfoot.\nnon_diegetic_music: A hybrid orchestral-electronic score at a relentless fast tempo, with pounding taiko drums, a driving string ostinato, and stabbing low brass; icy synth textures mark the woman's attacks while deep brass swells mark the man's. Risers climb on every high leap, then a massive sub-bass impact hit lands on the final weapon-lock, cutting to near-silence — only wind and falling snow — as the finisher lands and the fight ends.\n"
			],
